---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — FixLanka Tools"
  description="Terms and conditions for utilizing FixLanka Tools free online utilities."
  canonicalUrl="https://fixlanka.com/terms"
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-16 space-y-8">
    <header class="space-y-3">
      <span class="inline-block text-xs font-medium px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-brand-500/10 text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 border border-brand-500/20">
        Terms & Conditions
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold text-dark-text tracking-tight">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-dark-muted">
        Last Updated: November 2026
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-dark-secondary leading-relaxed">
      <section class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-dark-card border border-dark-border space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-dark-text">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing or using FixLanka Tools (<a href="https://fixlanka.com" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 underline">https://fixlanka.com</a>), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please discontinue use of the platform.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-dark-text">2. Permitted Use</h2>
        <p>
          FixLanka Tools is provided free of charge for personal, educational, and everyday use. You agree not to use the tools for:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-dark-secondary">
          <li>Unlawful activities or distributing harmful or prohibited files.</li>
          <li>Attempting to attack, disable, or disrupt our website infrastructure.</li>
          <li>Falsifying digital records or forging provenance metadata.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-dark-text">3. Disclaimers & Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          The tools are provided on an "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" basis without warranties of any kind. Please always keep backup copies of important original photos and documents before processing them.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-dark-text">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          You retain 100% ownership and rights to any photos, documents, or text you process through FixLanka Tools. We never claim ownership over your files.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-dark-text">5. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms of Service are governed by general principles of international commercial and electronic law.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>